        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "cp-en",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 660,
     "y": 406,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 40,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "(caption — to translate)",
         "sizePt": 11,
         "bold": false,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "pr-8shqwd",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "對齊與分佈",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：多選後右欄有左／中／右與上／中／下對齊，還有水平與垂直等距——等距要選三個以上，頭尾不動，中間平均分。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "格線",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：畫布右下角浮動列的「格線」鈕開關。三個層次看得出遠近——一格是虛線，每 5 格一條細實線，每 10 格一條粗實線，原點在投影片左上角，格距預設 5mm。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "格距、細線與粗線的間隔格數、顏色（預設 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "#ADB5BD",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "2E6DA4",
         "fontFace": "Menlo"
        },
        {
         "text": "），都在",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "格線鈕右半那個小箭頭",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "裡調。開關與細部設定放在一起，不在右欄。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "吸附",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：同一列的「吸附」打開後，",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "搬移只吸左緣與上緣",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "；拖白色方點縮放則四邊都吸，表格的欄寬列高把手與線條端點也一樣。整組搬移吸的是包圍盒的左上角，組內相對位置不會變。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "輔助線贏過格線",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：投影片中線、四邊、預留區外緣的吸附一直都在，而且優先於格線。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
