        },
        {
         "text": "無",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "、",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "• 符號",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "、",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "1. 編號",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，再用 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "−",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": " 與 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "＋",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": " 調縮排層級。每一層 18pt，就是 PowerPoint 預設的 0.25 吋，且是懸掛縮排——文字換行後會對齊到第一行的文字，不會跑到符號底下。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
