     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "先設筆，再選邊",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：用右欄的「框線筆」設好線寬與顏色，再點全部、外框、內部，或上下左右單邊。「無」是清掉框線。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "套用範圍和樣式一樣：有反白就只套那幾格，沒反白就是整張表。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "虛線",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：筆旁邊勾「虛線」再按，畫出來就是虛線。實線虛線可以逐格逐邊混用。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
